Third-party components
----------------------

YangBase depends on third-party libraries resolved at build time via Gradle.
Their licenses are declared in each dependency's own artifact metadata
(POM / Gradle module metadata). No third-party source code is vendored into
this repository.

If you redistribute a binary build of YangBase, you are responsible for
shipping the license texts of its runtime dependencies alongside your
distribution.

